WEBVTT

00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:01.742
Calling Cormorant.

00:00:01.782 --> 00:00:03.955
I see you, are you in one piece?

00:00:03.995 --> 00:00:05.364
Well, almost.

00:00:06.374 --> 00:00:08.884
The water truck is hooked up and pumping.

00:00:08.924 --> 00:00:10.489
Let's see how much you brought.

00:00:12.415 --> 00:00:15.600
Well done, you brought more
than three quarters of a tank.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.028
That's a great run.

00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:21.050
The old filter can still clean this water.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:25.364
Today everyone gets full flasks,
and the greenhouse gets water too.

00:00:26.415 --> 00:00:27.712
Good work, pilot.

00:00:27.752 --> 00:00:29.625
Here, this is your water.

00:00:29.665 --> 00:00:30.702
You've earned it.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.159
Get some rest.

00:00:34.199 --> 00:00:37.869
This water won't last long,
we may fly again tomorrow.
